{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":36,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, A ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Psalm"]}," of David, the servant of the LORD. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 36:1"},"The transgression of the wicked saith within my heart, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that there is"]}," no fear of God before his eyes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 36:2"},"For he flattereth himself in his own eyes, until his iniquity be found to be hateful. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 36:3"},"The words of his mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," iniquity and deceit: he hath left off to be wise, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," to do good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 36:4"},"He deviseth mischief upon his bed; he setteth himself in a way ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," not good; he abhorreth not evil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 36:5"},"Thy mercy, O LORD, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the heavens; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," thy faithfulness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["reacheth"]}," unto the clouds. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 36:6"},"Thy righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," like the great mountains; thy judgments ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," a great deep: O LORD, thou preservest man and beast. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 36:7"},"How excellent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," thy lovingkindness, O God! therefore the children of men put their trust under the shadow of thy wings. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 36:8"},"They shall be abundantly satisfied with the fatness of thy house; and thou shalt make them drink of the river of thy pleasures. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 36:9"},"For with thee ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the fountain of life: in thy light shall we see light. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 36:10"},"O continue thy lovingkindness unto them that know thee; and thy righteousness to the upright in heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 36:11"},"Let not the foot of pride come against me, and let not the hand of the wicked remove me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 36:12"},"There are the workers of iniquity fallen: they are cast down, and shall not be able to rise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 36:12"}]}]}
